    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Los\nAngeles\nInternational\nT\nPort",
      "LOS ANGELES INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT\nThe spectacular new Jet-Port offers the ultimate\nin passenger\nservice,\nconvenience and comfort.\nNote the\ncabin level \"Plane Boarding Ramps\"\nfeatured in all the\nSatellite facilities and the\nmagnificent Theme Building restaurant and control\ntower in background.\nDISTRIBUTED BY MITOCK \u0026 SONS, 13561 VENTURA BLVD., SHERMAN OAKS, CALIF\nCastichrome\nby COLOURPICTURE PUBLISHERS, INC.., Boston 30, Moss., U.S.A.\nP49511\nPUT\nSTAMP\nHERE\nPOST CARD\nColor courtesy American Airlines\n2015.166.2051"
